{
  "title": "Tutorial IPTV Smarters Pro",
  "description": "O guia completo para configurar o aplicativo mais popular em Android, iOS e TV Box.",
  "content": {
    "type": "text",
    "data": "<div class='space-y-10'><div class='bg-emerald-600/10 border-l-4 border-emerald-500 p-6 rounded-r-2xl mb-8'><p class='text-emerald-400 font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-2'><i class='fas fa-star'></i> Recomendado para Android</p><p class='text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1'>O IPTV Smarters Pro é leve, rápido e possui uma das melhores interfaces para quem usa TV Box ou Smartphones.</p></div><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>1</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>Abra o Aplicativo</h4><p class='text-gray-400 text-xs mb-4'>Ao abrir o app pela primeira vez, você verá algumas opções de login. Selecione a opção: <b class='text-white'>ADD YOUR PLAYLIST (via Xtream Codes API)</b>.</p><div class='rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-800 shadow-2xl max-w-sm bg-black/20 p-4 text-center'><i class='fas fa-users-cog text-4xl text-emerald-500 mb-2'></i><p class='text-[10px] text-gray-500 uppercase font-black'>Selecione Xtream Codes API</p></div></section><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>2</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>Preencha seus Dados</h4><p class='text-gray-400 text-xs mb-6'>Insira os dados de acesso que enviamos no seu WhatsApp. Siga a ordem exata abaixo:</p><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-gray-800 rounded-3xl p-6 space-y-4 shadow-xl'><div class='p-4 bg-[#0d1117] rounded-2xl border border-gray-800'><p class='text-[8px] font-black text-gray-500 uppercase mb-1'>Any Name (Qualquer Nome)</p><p class='text-[10px] font-bold text-white'>TopTV</p></div><div class='p-4 bg-[#0d1117] rounded-2xl border border-gray-800'><p class='text-[8px] font-black text-gray-500 uppercase mb-1'>Username (Usuário)</p><p class='text-[10px] font-bold text-white'>Seu Usuário IPTV</p></div><div class='p-4 bg-[#0d1117] rounded-2xl border border-gray-800'><p class='text-[8px] font-black text-gray-500 uppercase mb-1'>Password (Senha)</p><p class='text-[10px] font-bold text-white'>Sua Senha IPTV</p></div><div class='p-4 bg-[#0d1117] rounded-2xl border border-gray-800'><p class='text-[8px] font-black text-gray-500 uppercase mb-1'>URL do Servidor (http://...)</p><p class='text-[10px] font-bold text-sky-400'>Use a URL disponível em seu painel</p></div></div></section><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-purple-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>3</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>Dica de Performance</h4><div class='bg-yellow-600/10 border border-yellow-500/20 p-6 rounded-3xl'><p class='text-yellow-500 text-[10px] leading-relaxed'><i class='fas fa-bolt mr-1'></i> <b>IMPORTANTE:</b> Se notar lentidão no carregamento, vá em <b>Settings > Stream Format</b> e mude de 'Default' para <b>'MPEGTS (.ts)'</b>.</p></div></section><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>4</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>Vídeo Tutorial</h4><div class='rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden border border-gray-800 shadow-2xl mt-6'><div id='player' data-plyr-provider='html5' data-plyr-embed-id='placeholder'><video poster='/shared_assets/logo/logo-iptv-smarters.jpg' controls><source src='/shared_assets/videos_tutoriais/apps/troca-de-formato-streaming-iptv-smarters.mp4' type='video/mp4'></video></div></div></section></div>"
  }
}